abstract: "Simulation data and companion implementation for decision-focused learning of bounded wheel-force residuals in a physics-structured chassis world model. Includes recorded twin trajectories, reference-twin candidate-command evaluations, trained checkpoints and external-baseline CarSim step logs. Native simulator and licensed vehicle assets are not distributed."
